// SMC with MCMC moves, annealing with the next power chosen to give an
// effective sample size of 0.95 times the number of particles (with 0.5 the
// first step would already reach power 1: going straight from the prior to
// the posterior gives ESS about 0.87 N).
// Use with test_gaussian_posterior.ilike.

/***m_proposal,ilike::norm_rw(theta,1)***/

/***mcmc_termination,ilike::iterations(5)***/

/***smc_sequence,ilike::annealing(power,c(0,1))***/

/***adaptive_target,ilike::ess(0.95)***/
